          "date": "2026-11-13 03:53:04.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-19916 target: size handler tables to their opcode range",
        "message": "LU-19916 target: size handler tables to their opcode range\n\nMost tgt_handler tables were sized by their initializers, while the\nopcode slice that points at each one covers the whole range from\n*_FIRST_OPC to *_LAST_OPC.  Only tgt_dlm_handlers[],\nmgs_dlm_handlers[] and mgs_mgs_handlers[] were sized to their slice.\n\nSize the other shared and per-target handler tables to their opcode\nrange the same way, so that every opcode in a slice used by\ntgt_handler_find_check() has an entry, and one with no handler gets\n-EOPNOTSUPP.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 ltvm llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I6a1c32a7bbaafb6cc06eee5b4a102a94ca3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
